Theorem RL-18: LayoutCapabilities must Satisfy frozen facts

  Preconditions:
    - AllocationFacts and representation-owned ExtentClass are frozen.
    - VmLayoutPlan and CompiledLayoutPlan carry LayoutCapabilities.

  Soundness property:
    Forall facts F, extent E, and capabilities C:

      (P1) Satisfies(F, E, C) requires site and lifetime coverage.

      (P2) Satisfies requires extent support and sufficient OwnerBound capacity.

      (P3) Satisfies preserves exact OwnershipObservationFacts and cleanup identities.

      (P4) Satisfies covers unwind, ThreadReachability, and ExternalVisibility.

      (P5) A stronger capability preserves satisfaction only under the same
           logical event and external contract identities.

  Proof obligation:
    Constructive positive case with negative witnesses for insufficient owner
    capacity, missing runtime extent, and changed logical events.

    Part (P1..P5) - capability grid:
      adequate capabilities -> true
      insufficient owner capacity -> false
      missing runtime extent -> false
      changed event protocol -> false
      stronger same-contract capability -> true
      Coverage gate: 5 capability cases.

    Engines dispatched:
      case_analysis (PRIMARY - section_08::verify_rl18_layout_satisfaction;
        validated_vm_plan_sound and validated_compiled_plan_sound obligations)
      rc_counting (SECONDARY - gracious-accept per the coverage-manifest RL row)
      refinement (SECONDARY - gracious-accept per the coverage-manifest RL row)

  Expected:
    status: valid
    reason: section_08 case_analysis engine discharges RL-18 through Satisfies over lifetime, extent, owners, exact events, cleanup, unwind, thread reachability, visibility, and same-contract strengthening
